Use io.
Define local marks as array<whole number, 8>.
Set item 0 of marks to 7.
Set item 1 of marks to 9.
Set item 2 of marks to 11.
Set item 3 of marks to 13.
Set item 4 of marks to 15.
Set item 5 of marks to 17.
Set item 6 of marks to 19.
Set item 7 of marks to 21.
Let flags be 0.
If every x in marks is more than 0, add 1 to flags.
If some x in marks is more than 20, add 2 to flags.
If no x in marks is less than 0, add 4 to flags.
Say flags.
Give back 0.
